# ScoutAI - Competitive Intelligence Tool

## Implementation Plan

### Overview
A web application that allows users to input multiple competitor website URLs, scrapes their content using Firecrawl, analyzes competitive positioning using OpenAI, and stores results in Supabase for future reference.

### Architecture

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[React Frontend<br/>Vite + Dark/Light Mode] --> B[Express.js Backend<br/>API Server]
    B --> C[Firecrawl API<br/>Web Scraping]
    B --> D[OpenAI API<br/>AI Analysis]
    B --> E[Supabase<br/>Database & Storage]
    A --> E
```

### Tech Stack
| Component | Technology | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------|---------|
| Frontend | Vite + React | Bolt-style rapid UI development |
| Styling | Vanilla CSS | Dark/light mode, premium design |
| Backend API | Express.js | API orchestration layer |
| Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL) | Store analyses & history |
| Scraping | Firecrawl API | Extract website content |
| AI Analysis | OpenAI GPT-4 | Competitive intelligence |

